{"ref":"BDB, לָקַק","hw":"לָקַק","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">לָקַק</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. lap, lick (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Pi.; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">لَقَّ</span> <em>lick, lap</em> of dog (Wahrm)<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָֽקְקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.19\">1 K 21:19</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָלֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:5\" href=\"/Judges.7.5\">Ju 7:5</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָלֹ֫קּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.19\">1 K 21:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּלֹ֫קּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:38\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.38\">1 K 22:38</a>;—<em>lap</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יָלֹק בִּלְשׁוֹנוֹ מִן־הַמַּיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:5\" href=\"/Judges.7.5\">Ju 7:5</a>, like a dog v <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:5\" href=\"/Judges.7.5\">5</a> (abs.); of dogs <em>lapping up</em> blood (acc.), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.19\">1 K 21:19</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:38\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.38\">22:38</a>.<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Pt. pl. c. art. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְֿלַקְקִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:6\" href=\"/Judges.7.6\">Ju 7:6</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּיָדָם אֶל־פִּיהֶם</span> is erron. gloss, v. GFM), v <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:7\" href=\"/Judges.7.7\">7</a>; in both = <em>lap, lap up</em> (= <strong>Qal</strong> v <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:5\" href=\"/Judges.7.5\">5</a>).","next":"BDB, לקשׁ","prev":"BDB, יַלְקוּט²"}